RIGHTS AND AVAILABILITY
=======================

The original work, Éléments de géométrie algébrique, is by Alexandre Grothendieck and Jean Dieudonné. The rights in
the original work remain with its rights holders.

To the extent that the publisher holds any copyright or related rights in the AI-produced translation, corrections
and typesetting published here, they are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). The dedication covers only those contributions; it does not
affect the rights in the original work and grants no permission to use it.

Editions published here are made available free of charge for non-commercial, purely educational purposes, on the
presumption that the respective rights holders would not object to their being freely available alongside the French
originals on NUMDAM (https://www.numdam.org/journals/PMIHES/). This presumption is not a statement that permission
has been obtained; free access to the originals does not itself grant permission to translate, adapt or republish
them.

If you hold rights in any material presented here and object to its availability, please open a GitHub issue
(https://github.com/KokunoYumeto/ega-en/issues). The publisher will take down the affected material at the rights
holder's request.
